# Owner-local eval cases (evals/README.md): a `*.local.json` case lets the
# owner point the fit suite at a real description for one-off testing without
# ever committing it -- the golden cases in evals/cases/ stay invented and
# generic (the plan's generic-engine rule), same split as private-doc.mjs
# keeps between this repo and the documents it deploys.
evals/cases/**/*.local.json

# design-sync build output (regenerate with node .design-sync/build-styles.mjs)
ds-bundle/

# The rendered sheet (issue #183). `npm run resume:pdf` writes it next to the
# golden extraction it produces, because 04's structural checks -- pdfinfo,
# pdffonts, qpdf --check -- need both in one place. The PDF itself is a build
# artifact that belongs in R2 (issue #185), not in this history; the golden
# beside it IS committed, because a text diff is what review reads.
#
# tests/fixtures/resume-sheet-sample.pdf is NOT this file and stays committed:
# it is #182's frozen render, which the metadata stamper asserts against.
tests/fixtures/resume-sheet.pdf

# The pinned Chrome for Testing build (scripts/resume-chrome.mjs).
.chrome/
